11
01:01:52,500 --> 01:01:58,500
The film also stars Woody Harrelson, Tommy Lee Jones, James Marsden, Milla Jovovich, and Jessica Biel, and follows a group of journalists at
Knight Ridder's Washington Bureau who investigate the rationale behind the Bush Administration's then-impending 2003 invasion of Iraq.

12
01:07:30,000 --> 01:07:36,000
The film had its world premiere at the Zurich Film
Festival on September 30, 2017.

13
01:13:07,500 --> 01:13:13,500
It was released through DirecTV Cinema on June 14, 2018, before having a limited
release in theaters on July 13, 2018, by Vertical Entertainment.

14
01:18:45,000 --> 01:18:51,000
The film explores themes of journalist, iraq war, 9/11, usa politics.

15
